  "prefLabel": "Saf-Mec 602.01 Imminent threat to life safety",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 602.01 “Imminent threat to life safety” means any condition, operating feature, or combination thereof that when energized presents a hazard that could cause property damage through fire or explosion, or health or life safety hazards to the occupants, residents, or property owners.\n\nSource. #12385, eff 9-20-17",
